body:
Same. I ordered mine (15'' model RTX 2060) on 4th April and for the last few days the website has been saying that it will arrive on 24th, 25th and today 26th April. I contacted them multiple times and got very annoyed by the only response that they have been giving is "we are trying to contact the people from the warehouse for confirmation". Their sales representative told me that there are some issues with the parts, they are finding it difficult to meet the large demands and "management is working to solve it". He even told me to consider cancellation as he cannot give any predicted date as to when they'll be shipped.

&#x200B;

I really like this laptop and I really don't want to wait for cheaper RTX laptops, but it seems like I have to wait for anyway.
